    "human_label": "Analyze"
  },
  {
    "index": 59,
    "sentence": "This can be verified by writing:\n  1/(j - 1) - 1/j = (j - (j - 1))/(j(j - 1)) = 1/(j(j - 1)).",
    "sentence-type": "answer",
    "human_label": "Verify"
  },
  {
    "index": 60,
    "sentence": "Step 5.",
    "sentence-type": "answer",
    "human_label": "Monitor"
  },
  {
    "index": 61,
    "sentence": "Write the telescoping sum:\n  S = Σⱼ₌₂^2008 (1/(j - 1) - 1/j)\n    = (1/1 - 1/2) + (1/2 - 1/3) + ⋯ + (1/2007 - 1/2008).",
